6. NETWORK AND CONNECTIVITY MONITORING

Design network observability based on the actual infrastructure.

6.1 Required Metrics

Investigate:

* Incoming traffic.
* Outgoing traffic.
* Bandwidth utilization.
* Request volume.
* Network latency.
* DNS resolution latency.
