1. OBSERVED FACT.
2. CORRELATED EVENT.
3. POSSIBLE CAUSE.
4. STRONGLY SUPPORTED HYPOTHESIS.
5. CONFIRMED ROOT CAUSE.
6. UNRESOLVED.

Do not allow AI-generated diagnostic text to change an unresolved hypothesis into a confirmed cause.

